{'symbol': 'ADM', 'date': '2021-06-02 09:00:00', 'title': 'ADM JOINS THE GENESIS CONSORTIUM TO SUPPORT STARTUPS POWERING THE FUTURE OF SUSTAINABLE INNOVATION', 'text': 'CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ADM VENTURES, THE CORPORATE VENTURE CAPITAL ARM OF ADM (NYSE: ADM), TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS COLLABORATION WITH THE GENESIS CONSORTIUM. GENESIS, FOUNDED BY SILICON VALLEY-BASED INVESTORS SOSV AND MAYFIELD FUND, IS A GLOBAL ALLIANCE OF VENTURE CAPITAL FIRMS AND CORPORATIONS DEDICATED TO SUPPORTING STARTUPS THAT LEVERAGE BIOLOGY TO PROMOTE HUMAN AND PLANETARY HEALTH. SOSV IS THE PARENT COMPANY OF INDIEBIO, A LEADING STARTUP ACCELERATOR AND EARLY-STAGE INVESTOR FOR BIOLOGY-CEN'}